  "name": "sequence-send",
  "description": "One fired step of one enrollment (BO-F3-03): the evidence a step was queued into the channels outbox under its deterministic key, is waiting for a human approval, was confirmed sent, or died there. Metrics count these rows, never stored counters, so a crash or a retry cannot drift them. (backlog:22bb154a72ea)",
